  "OUTLIER_CAVEAT": "CORRECTED before publication -- my first draft said outliers are DOMINATED by small-denominator artifacts. The data does not support that. TRUE: the extreme tail is a small-denominator artifact (top outlier Jacob Villarreal +77.6 pct on BMV 8,925.91 against a -10,200.58 outflow -- a percentage of a tiny base). NOT TRUE: that this explains the 30 outliers as a class. Only 6 of 30 sit under 1M BMV, and median outlier BMV (5,661,399) is roughly HALF the in-band median (10,456,549), not far below it. So 24 of 30 outliers are NOT explained by a small base and remain UNEXPLAINED. Do not read this field as having dispositioned them.",
